{"seq":1,"slug":"observability-design","title":"全栈可观测性设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/fullstack-operations/observability-design","wordCount":1525,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"全栈可观测性设计\">全栈可观测性设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可观测性不同于传统监控：<strong>监控回答&quot;系统是否正常&quot;，可观测性回答&quot;系统为什么异常&quot;</strong>。它的基础是 Metrics、Logs、Traces 三支柱的协同——Metrics 发现异常、Traces 定位服务、Logs 确认根因。在全栈分布式系统中，一个用户请求可能跨越前端渲染、API Gateway、BFF、多个微服务与数据存储，因此采集需要统一标准：OpenTelemetry 通过 OTel SDK 与 OTLP 协议把三种信号收敛到任意后端，并借助 W3C Trace Context 实现前端到后端的端到端链路串联。可观测性还要配以 SLO 驱动的告警体系，让 On-call 工程师在业务影响层先被通知、再逐层下钻到根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性的三支柱\">可观测性的三支柱</h2><p>可观测性（Observability）不同于传统监控（Monitoring）——监控回答&quot;系统是否正常&quot;，可观测性回答&quot;系统为什么异常&quot;。在分布式全栈系统中，一个用户请求可能跨越前端渲染、API Gateway、BFF 层、3-5 个微服务和 2-3 个数据存储。没有完整的可观测性体系，排障就像在黑暗中摸索。</p>\n<p>可观测性三支柱的协同关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Metrics 指标&#10;        M[系统是否健康？错误率/延迟/吞吐量]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Logs 日志&#10;        L[具体发生了什么？请求详情/错误堆栈]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Traces 链路追踪&#10;        T[请求经过了哪些服务？每段耗时多少？]&#10;    end&#10;    M --&gt;|发现异常| T&#10;    T --&gt;|定位服务| L&#10;    L --&gt;|确认根因| Fix[修复]\">graph TB\n    subgraph Metrics 指标\n        M[系统是否健康？错误率/延迟/吞吐量]\n    end\n    subgraph Logs 日志\n        L[具体发生了什么？请求详情/错误堆栈]\n    end\n    subgraph Traces 链路追踪\n        T[请求经过了哪些服务？每段耗时多少？]\n    end\n    M --&gt;|发现异常| T\n    T --&gt;|定位服务| L\n    L --&gt;|确认根因| Fix[修复]</pre><p>典型排障流程：Metrics 告警发现错误率上升 → Traces 定位到是 Payment Service 的延迟飙升 → Logs 确认是第三方支付网关超时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"opentelemetry-统一采集框架\">OpenTelemetry 统一采集框架</h2><p>OpenTelemetry（OTel）已在 2026 年成为可观测性数据采集的事实标准。它提供统一的 SDK 和 API，将 Metrics、Logs、Traces 三种信号通过标准化协议（OTLP）发送到任意后端（Datadog、Grafana、New Relic、自建系统）。</p>\n<p><strong>架构概览</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 应用层&#10;        FE[前端 - OTel JS SDK]&#10;        BFF[BFF - OTel Node SDK]&#10;        Svc[微服务 - OTel Go/Java SDK]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 采集层&#10;        Collector[OTel Collector]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 存储与分析&#10;        Metrics_BE[(Prometheus / Mimir)]&#10;        Traces_BE[(Tempo / Jaeger)]&#10;        Logs_BE[(Loki / Elasticsearch)]&#10;    end&#10;    FE --&gt; Collector&#10;    BFF --&gt; Collector&#10;    Svc --&gt; Collector&#10;    Collector --&gt; Metrics_BE&#10;    Collector --&gt; Traces_BE&#10;    Collector --&gt; Logs_BE\">graph LR\n    subgraph 应用层\n        FE[前端 - OTel JS SDK]\n        BFF[BFF - OTel Node SDK]\n        Svc[微服务 - OTel Go/Java SDK]\n    end\n    subgraph 采集层\n        Collector[OTel Collector]\n    end\n    subgraph 存储与分析\n        Metrics_BE[(Prometheus / Mimir)]\n        Traces_BE[(Tempo / Jaeger)]\n        Logs_BE[(Loki / Elasticsearch)]\n    end\n    FE --&gt; Collector\n    BFF --&gt; Collector\n    Svc --&gt; Collector\n    Collector --&gt; Metrics_BE\n    Collector --&gt; Traces_BE\n    Collector --&gt; Logs_BE</pre><p><strong>Node.js 服务接入示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { NodeSDK } from &#39;@opentelemetry/sdk-node&#39;;&#10;import { getNodeAutoInstrumentations } from &#39;@opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node&#39;;&#10;import { OTLPTraceExporter } from &#39;@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http&#39;;&#10;import { OTLPMetricExporter } from &#39;@opentelemetry/exporter-metrics-otlp-http&#39;;&#10;&#10;const sdk = new NodeSDK({&#10;  serviceName: &#39;order-bff&#39;,&#10;  traceExporter: new OTLPTraceExporter({&#10;    url: &#39;http://otel-collector:4318/v1/traces&#39;,&#10;  }),&#10;  metricReader: new PeriodicExportingMetricReader({&#10;    exporter: new OTLPMetricExporter({&#10;      url: &#39;http://otel-collector:4318/v1/metrics&#39;,&#10;    }),&#10;  }),&#10;  instrumentations: [getNodeAutoInstrumentations()],&#10;});&#10;&#10;sdk.start();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NodeSDK } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/sdk-node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { getNodeAutoInstrumentations } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { OTLPTraceExporter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { OTLPMetricExporter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/exporter-metrics-otlp-http'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sdk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NodeSDK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  serviceName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-bff'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  traceExporter: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OTLPTraceExporter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://otel-collector:4318/v1/traces'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metricReader: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PeriodicExportingMetricReader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exporter: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OTLPMetricExporter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://otel-collector:4318/v1/metrics'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instrumentations: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNodeAutoInstrumentations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sdk.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动插桩覆盖 HTTP、gRPC、数据库客户端、消息队列等常见库，无需手动在每个调用点添加追踪代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前端可观测性\">前端可观测性</h2><p>全栈可观测性的一个常见盲区是前端。后端的 Metrics/Traces/Logs 通常完善，但用户设备上的体验数据却缺乏系统化采集。</p>\n<p><strong>前端观测维度</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>LCP、FID/INP、CLS、TTFB</td>\n<td>Performance API / Web Vitals 库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误</td>\n<td>JS 异常、资源加载失败、API 错误</td>\n<td>window.onerror / Sentry SDK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为</td>\n<td>页面浏览、用户交互、功能使用率</td>\n<td>自定义事件 / Analytics SDK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络</td>\n<td>API 延迟、失败率、载荷大小</td>\n<td>Fetch/XHR 拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源</td>\n<td>Bundle 大小、缓存命中率</td>\n<td>Resource Timing API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>前端 Trace 串联</strong>：关键是将前端发起的请求与后端链路追踪关联。通过在 HTTP 请求头中注入 Trace Context（W3C Trace Context 标准），实现端到端的链路可见：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 前端 Fetch 拦截 - 注入 Trace Context&#10;const originalFetch = window.fetch;&#10;window.fetch = async (url, options = {}) =&gt; {&#10;  const span = tracer.startSpan(`HTTP ${options.method || &#39;GET&#39;} ${url}`);&#10;  const headers = new Headers(options.headers);&#10;&#10;  // 注入 W3C Trace Context&#10;  propagator.inject(context.active(), headers, {&#10;    set: (carrier, key, value) =&gt; carrier.set(key, value),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    const response = await originalFetch(url, { ...options, headers });&#10;    span.setStatus({ code: response.ok ? SpanStatusCode.OK : SpanStatusCode.ERROR });&#10;    return response;&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    span.recordException(error);&#10;    throw error;&#10;  } finally {&#10;    span.end();&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 前端 Fetch 拦截 - 注入 Trace Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> originalFetch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.fetch;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> span</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startSpan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`HTTP ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">options</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'GET'} ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(options.headers);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 注入 W3C Trace Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  propagator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">active</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), headers, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">carrier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, value),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> originalFetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url, { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">options, headers });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code: response.ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SpanStatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SpanStatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">recordException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"分布式链路追踪\">分布式链路追踪</h2><p>在微服务架构中，链路追踪是定位性能瓶颈和故障传播路径的核心工具。</p>\n<p><strong>Trace 的数据结构</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Trace (全局唯一 ID)&#10;└── Span: API Gateway (12ms)&#10;    ├── Span: Auth Middleware (2ms)&#10;    └── Span: BFF Service (10ms)&#10;        ├── Span: User Service Call (3ms)&#10;        │   └── Span: PostgreSQL Query (1ms)&#10;        ├── Span: Order Service Call (5ms)&#10;        │   ├── Span: Redis Cache Lookup (0.5ms)&#10;        │   └── Span: MongoDB Query (3ms)&#10;        └── Span: Response Serialization (1ms)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Trace (全局唯一 ID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Span: API Gateway (12ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── Span: Auth Middleware (2ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── Span: BFF Service (10ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── Span: User Service Call (3ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        │   └── Span: PostgreSQL Query (1ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── Span: Order Service Call (5ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        │   ├── Span: Redis Cache Lookup (0.5ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        │   └── Span: MongoDB Query (3ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── Span: Response Serialization (1ms)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>采样策略</strong>：生产环境不能追踪 100% 的请求（存储和性能成本过高），需要智能采样：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采样策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概率采样</td>\n<td>固定比例（如 1%）采样</td>\n<td>高流量服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部采样</td>\n<td>先收集完整 Trace，对异常/慢请求全量保留</td>\n<td>需要捕获异常场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级采样</td>\n<td>关键业务路径 100%、非关键路径 0.1%</td>\n<td>混合流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应采样</td>\n<td>根据流量动态调整采样率</td>\n<td>流量波动大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"告警设计原则\">告警设计原则</h2><p>好的告警系统遵循&quot;尽早发现、精准通知、快速定位&quot;原则：</p>\n<p><strong>SLO 驱动告警</strong>：不监控每个中间指标，而是围绕 Service Level Objective 设置告警：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# SLO 定义示例&#10;slos:&#10;  - name: order-api-availability&#10;    target: 99.9% # 每月允许 43 分钟不可用&#10;    indicator:&#10;      type: availability&#10;      good_events: &quot;http_requests_total{status!~&#39;5..&#39;}&quot;&#10;      total_events: &#39;http_requests_total&#39;&#10;    alerts:&#10;      - burn_rate: 14.4x # 1小时窗口，1小时耗尽月度预算&#10;        severity: critical&#10;        notify: [pagerduty, slack-oncall]&#10;      - burn_rate: 6x # 6小时窗口&#10;        severity: warning&#10;        notify: [slack-alerts]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># SLO 定义示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">slos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-api-availability</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">99.9%</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每月允许 43 分钟不可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    indicator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">availability</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      good_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http_requests_total{status!~'5..'}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      total_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http_requests_total'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    alerts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">burn_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">14.4x</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 1小时窗口，1小时耗尽月度预算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        notify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pagerduty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slack-oncall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">burn_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">6x</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 6小时窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        notify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slack-alerts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>告警金字塔</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 第一层 - 业务影响&#10;        BIZ[用户可感知的异常:错误率/延迟 SLO 违约]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 第二层 - 系统征兆&#10;        SYS[资源接近饱和:CPU &gt; 80% / 内存 &gt; 90%]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 第三层 - 原因指标&#10;        CAUSE[具体原因:DB 慢查询增多 / 队列堆积]&#10;    end&#10;    BIZ --&gt; SYS&#10;    SYS --&gt; CAUSE\">graph TB\n    subgraph 第一层 - 业务影响\n        BIZ[用户可感知的异常:错误率/延迟 SLO 违约]\n    end\n    subgraph 第二层 - 系统征兆\n        SYS[资源接近饱和:CPU &gt; 80% / 内存 &gt; 90%]\n    end\n    subgraph 第三层 - 原因指标\n        CAUSE[具体原因:DB 慢查询增多 / 队列堆积]\n    end\n    BIZ --&gt; SYS\n    SYS --&gt; CAUSE</pre><p>告警应从上到下触发：先告知&quot;有业务影响&quot;，再引导定位原因。避免让 On-call 工程师淹没在大量底层告警中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性成熟度模型\">可观测性成熟度模型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>关键标志</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 基础</td>\n<td>基本日志 + 基础指标</td>\n<td>能发现&quot;系统挂了&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 结构化</td>\n<td>结构化日志 + APM + 基础告警</td>\n<td>能定位&quot;哪个服务挂了&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 关联</td>\n<td>分布式追踪 + 日志关联 + SLO 告警</td>\n<td>能回答&quot;为什么挂了&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 预测</td>\n<td>异常检测 + 容量预测 + 变更关联</td>\n<td>能预防&quot;即将出问题&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5 自愈</td>\n<td>AI 辅助根因分析 + 自动修复</td>\n<td>系统自行恢复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年大多数组织处于 L2-L3 之间。L4/L5 需要大量历史数据积累和 AIOps 平台支持，是长期投入方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全栈-dashboard-设计\">全栈 Dashboard 设计</h2><p>一个有效的全栈 Dashboard 应从用户体验出发，逐层下钻到基础设施：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户体验层</td>\n<td>Core Web Vitals、JS 错误率、用户满意度</td>\n<td>Sentry、Web Vitals Dashboard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 层</td>\n<td>请求延迟 P50/P95/P99、错误率、吞吐量</td>\n<td>Grafana + Prometheus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务层</td>\n<td>各服务 RED 指标（Rate/Error/Duration）</td>\n<td>Grafana + Traces</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据层</td>\n<td>查询延迟、连接池使用率、缓存命中率</td>\n<td>数据库原生监控 + Grafana</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施层</td>\n<td>CPU、内存、网络 I/O、磁盘</td>\n<td>Kubernetes 指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>全栈可观测性的终极目标是：当任何环节出现问题时，On-call 工程师能在 5 分钟内定位到根因服务和具体错误，而不是花费 30 分钟在多个工具间切换、猜测问题所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>可观测性回答&quot;为什么&quot;</strong>：三支柱协同——Metrics 发现异常、Traces 定位服务、Logs 确认根因。</li>\n<li><strong>OpenTelemetry 是事实标准</strong>：统一 SDK + OTLP 协议将三种信号收敛到任意后端，自动插桩消除手动埋点。</li>\n<li><strong>前端是可观测性盲区</strong>：采集 Core Web Vitals、JS 错误、行为与网络指标，并通过 W3C Trace Context 串联端到端链路。</li>\n<li><strong>分布式追踪定位瓶颈</strong>：Trace/Span 层级揭示请求经过的每个服务与每段耗时，采样策略平衡成本与覆盖。</li>\n<li><strong>告警要 SLO 驱动且分层</strong>：围绕 Service Level Objective 与 burn rate 设置告警，按&quot;业务影响 → 系统征兆 → 原因指标&quot;逐层下钻。</li>\n<li><strong>成熟度是渐进过程</strong>：L1 基础到 L5 自愈，2026 年多数组织处于 L2-L3，L4/L5 依赖历史数据与 AIOps 长期投入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全栈可观测性设计","id":"全栈可观测性设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性的三支柱","id":"可观测性的三支柱"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenTelemetry 统一采集框架","id":"opentelemetry-统一采集框架"},{"level":2,"text":"前端可观测性","id":"前端可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式链路追踪","id":"分布式链路追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"告警设计原则","id":"告警设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性成熟度模型","id":"可观测性成熟度模型"},{"level":2,"text":"全栈 Dashboard 设计","id":"全栈-dashboard-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"渐进式前端架构迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/frontend-migration"},"next":{"title":"部署策略与发布工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/fullstack-operations/deployment-strategies"}}